      "writtenOn": "2023-01-13T21:00:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What\u0027s the logic on the host side? To use 0 for stalled, we need to combine it with another signal (GPIO_EN_FAN, pwm_get_enabled, etc.).\n\nAlso, you need to fix ectool.cc (i.e. cmd_pwm_get_fan_rpm).",
