        "id": 1386300
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-16T14:37:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve added detailed info about the current issue observed and usage of this from Host side in comment https://partnerissuetracker.corp.google.com/issues/261701530#comment7 \nAs per my understanding, we might not need to add any other check because this EC_FAN_SPEED_STALLED is being used only at two places, [1] pwm_fan_second() function in \"common/fan.c\" file [2] print_fan() function in \"util/ectool.cc\" file and no other dependency there. \nAlso, regarding ectool.cc, it\u0027s already taken care for cmd_pwm_get_fan_rpm because as mentioned above this EC_FAN_SPEED_STALLED is used in above two functions and this cmd_pwm_get_fan_rpm() function is calling  print_fan() function. Above two functions mentioned in [1] and [2] are using EC_MEMMAP_FAN location for fan rpm.",
      "parentUuid": "c0b0eaa7_f289a348",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 255,
        "startChar": 31,
        "endLine": 255,
        "endChar": 32
      },
      "revId": "59842b5b57d110f75b86865b1a2973bd1a698257",
