      "writtenOn": "2023-01-20T18:44:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e We do not see any condition to take an action in code when RPM is forced to 0 (due to stalled)...\n\nCan you elaborate on this? I need to make a decision on whether we get rid of EC_FAN_SPEED_STALLED entirely (everywhere) or not.",
      "parentUuid": "2ef79645_60efb2d2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 255,
        "startChar": 31,
        "endLine": 255,
        "endChar": 32
      },
