      "writtenOn": "2023-02-10T07:25:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Chih, Can you change the specific condition check for rpm \u003d 0 instead of 0xfffe  in toolkit code? Because fan stalled means, fan is stopped \u0026 rpm is expected to be 0.",
      "parentUuid": "d7b8b66a_2754c473",
