        "id": 1521968
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-10T07:27:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In ectool.cc, the function seems to print `Fan %d stalled!` if rv equals to `EC_FAN_SPEED_STALLED`.\n\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/main:util/ectool.cc;l\u003d3650\n\nAnd the toolkit can\u0027t parse the output now, we\u0027re considering to modify the parse logic, or make ectool still return `Fan %d RPM: 0`.\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromiumos/platform/factory/+/main:py/device/fan.py;l\u003d63",
      "parentUuid": "d7b8b66a_2754c473",
      "range": {
