      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-10T07:52:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Removing the print from ectool.cc and make it return \"Fan %d RPM: 0\" should be ok, i think. Because, whenever fan stalled specific condition is met, there is already a print , which gives enough information from ec log about fan got stalled condition.(https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/main:common/fan.c;l\u003d583)\nMeanwhile,  you may  also modify the parse logic too, if specifically when fan is stopped needs to be known.",
